## Design language derived from KiroCrew

The visual language of this design system — its surface ladder, accent role,
spacing rhythm, control density, radius scale, focus treatment, glass surfaces,
and scrollbar affordances — is substantially translated and modified from
KiroCrew (https://github.com/kirodotdev/KiroCrew):

    Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. All Rights Reserved.
    KiroCrew is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and includes
    software developed at Amazon.com, Inc. (https://www.amazon.com/).

The translation is deliberate and total: KiroCrew's React components and its
bespoke CSS custom properties are re-expressed here as SolidJS components built
on Kobalte and corvu primitives, styled through the shadcn/ui semantic token
vocabulary carried in OKLCH. No KiroCrew source file is reproduced verbatim.

## Consumed libraries

Components are built on these upstream dependencies, which are consumed rather
than copied:

    Kobalte (@kobalte/core)        MIT License
    corvu (@corvu/*)               MIT License
